  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131nda, son zamanlarda pek rastlamad\u0131\u011F\u0131m ilgin\xE7 g\xF6rseller
    var. Kap\u0131s\u0131 kilitli bir kul\xFCbenin \xF6n\xFCnde belirmi\u015Fsin
    {{isim}}. Kap\u0131ya kula\u011F\u0131n\u0131 dayam\u0131\u015F, duvarlar\u0131n
    ard\u0131ndan adeta yank\u0131l\u0131 ve c\u0131l\u0131z bir \u015Fekilde duyulan
    yard\u0131m \xE7\u0131\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 dinliyorsun. \u0130\xE7eride,
    ad\u0131n\u0131n ilk hecesi {{sayi,2,3}} harften olu\u015Fan, soyad\u0131nda
    ise \"\xC7, \u011E, I, \xD6, \u015E, \xDC\" gibi T\xFCrk\xE7e karakterlerden
    bar\u0131nd\u0131ran biri oldu\u011Funu hissediyorum. Bu ki\u015Fi zor durumda.
    Ne evlili\u011Finde, ne de i\u015F konusunda senin kadar \u015Fansl\u0131 de\u011Fil.
    Kimseden destek istedi\u011Fini de d\xFC\u015F\xFCnm\xFCyorum. {{ay_+1}} ay\u0131n\u0131n
    ba\u015F\u0131nda duyaca\u011F\u0131n bir m\xFC\u015Fk\xFCl\xFCnde ona yard\u0131mc\u0131
    olursan, o da kendi alan\u0131nda sana b\xFCy\xFCk bir kap\u0131 a\xE7acak."
